what is going on everybody welcome back  to the cosmic wonder i'm your host  warren thompson and today i can't  believe it we didn't just get the entire  phase 5 reveal but marvel studios gave  us phase six as well including the date  of the fantastic four and two new  avengers movies that are going to be  coming out in the same year so let's go  ahead and just break it on down right  away we also got our very first teaser  for black panther to wakanda forever and  it looks absolutely amazing i'll be  doing a breakdown of the wakanda forever  trailer tomorrow so keep an eye out for  that but let's dive into the huge  reveals of marvel's phase six now they  didn't give us all of phase six but they  have teased us with probably the biggest  things of phase 6. to start off with the  biggest news we have an official release  date for the fantastic four the  fantastic four will release on november  8th of 2024  just a little over two years from now  that is when marvel's first family is  going to be making their debut now they  really didn't give us any other  information about the fantastic four  simply when it is going to come out and  some people are saying that the  fantastic four are going to start phase  six but if you take a look here it  actually says there's a project coming  out of fall of 2024. of course we'll  speculate what that's going to be in a  different video but for now let's move  on to the avengers announcements we are  getting two avengers movies in one  year the first one is coming out may 2nd  2025 and it is avengers the kang dynasty  now we talked about this yesterday but  it was a little bit of a premature  reveal now marvel studios has officially  revealed it and we can talk about it but  before we break this down and what to  expect in the king dynasty let's talk  about the second avengers film which is  of course avengers secret wars  now this is pretty crazy we have two  avengers films coming out in the same  year the king dynasty is may 2nd of 2025  and avengers secret wars is november 7th  of 2025 as well we've never had this  happen before even infinity war and  in-game were a year apart and i'm kind  of thinking that avengers the king  dynasty and secret wars are a part one  and a part two that's why they are so  close together it's also pretty amazing  that we are getting these avengers films  so soon and of course we have to talk  about the x-men don't worry we will talk  about that in this video because there  are some release dates that don't have  titles revealed to them yet and i'm  assuming the mutants are there somewhere  but first let's talk about what to  expect from these avengers films well  the first one is called the kang dynasty  now i think this title is actually very  important if you are unfamiliar with  what a dynasty is the definition is a  line of hereditary rulers of a country  or a succession of people from the same  family who play a prominent role in  business politics or another field and  this is coming straight from oxford  languages now the reason that i think  that this is important because this  talks about a line of hereditary rulers  or a line of rulers from the same family  throughout generations of time so this  title is implying that kang actually has  a dynasty however the dynasty is simply  going to be himself kang the conqueror  was originally nathaniel richards who  was from the future he managed to put  together a time machine and travel back  in time all the way to ancient egypt and  he actually became the pharaoh rama tut  so kang's dynasty could have started in  ancient egypt and i believe that that is  the route that they're going to go now  if we go back to loki season one the  ending told us pretty much everything  that we needed to know and this is  actually why i think avengers the king  dynasty is actually part one and  avengers secret wars is part two because  kang is the one who originally started  the multiversal war avengers secret wars  in the comics is about the multiverse  specifically the destruction of the  multiverse and pretty much it fusing  into just one universe one planet battle  world we'll get to that in just a second  but kang and all of his variants are the  one that originally started the  multiversal war until he who remains  ended it using goliath however he was  very clear when talking to loki and  silvie that if they killed him his  variants would be released all of these  different branch timelines would be  created and variants of king the  conqueror would exist in each of these  branch timelines now before this there  were no other kang the conquerors in the  mcu he who remains made it to where  there was only him that's why he  controlled the timeline however he is  now gone and the variants are released  we're going to see one a main one in  ant-man and the wasp quantomania he is  going to be the main villain along with  modok they did reveal that modok is  indeed going to be a villain in ant-man  3. so that's going to be fun as well but  in terms of kang's dynasty the kang  dynasty i'm assuming that different  variants of kang from different points  in time are going to end up on our earth  i also believe that they'll be on other  earths and other universes and  eventually the universes are going to  have to start communicating with each  other because again the next avengers  film that comes out months later not  years months later is secret wars and  the story of secret wars is that  incursions occur in the multiverse until  they eventually all collide and this is  kind of what we want to happen because  this is where we are going to see all of  the different variants from different  universes come together in one universe  so kang's dynasty is going to be the  cause of secret wars so we're going to  start to see multiple variants of kang  throughout the mcu starting in phase 5  with ant-man and the wasp quantum mania  we'll get a little bit of his backstory  and maybe some other variants back  stories as well because they're going to  be different they'll establish the  character and that will eventually take  them to avengers the king dynasty where  the avengers go okay we have to stop  this guy now i don't think they actually  will or if they do i think it's going to  be too late because we would not be  getting avengers secret wars if they  were successful so i'm kind of thinking  the kang dynasty is going to end  somewhat similar to avengers infinity  war the bad guy wins and then the  avengers have to do some true avenging  but the great part is it's not just  going to be the avengers that's the  whole point of secret wars and the  multiverse we're going to have the x-men  there as well of course along with a  fantastic four which have already been  revealed but like i mentioned before  they only revealed three projects of  marvel's entire phase six now of course  this is because they're saving the rest  of the reveals for d23 which is coming  in a couple of months so you have to  imagine since they revealed the  fantastic four release date since they  revealed something as huge as the next  two avengers films you have to imagine  that these other projects that were not  revealed here have to be pretty dang  amazing because two avengers films is  pretty much as big as it gets but at the  same time we know marvel has to save  something to wow us with at disney's d23  event so i'm assuming that some of these  dates on here that don't have titles are  for not only one x-men project but  multiple x-men projects because if you  think about it you have to be familiar  with some of the x-men that are going to  be in secret wars otherwise you're not  going to be too invested in the  characters so here we have 11 projects  for phase six that's eight projects that  have not been announced that i'm  assuming are all going to be announced  at d23 also keep in mind that the next  spider-man film is probably in one of  these slots and at the last san diego  comic-con that marvel attended in 2019  kevin feige did mention the mutants  which means they are coming so once  again i assume that's for d23 and is  going to go in probably a early slot in  phase 6 because again there has to be  some time since they're introduced so  they can fit well in the king dynasty  and secret wars so phase five and phase  six today that have been revealed have  been nothing short of spectacular i  don't think fans thought we'd get an  avengers film so soon let alone two in  one year but this also makes me even  more excited for d23 now because you  know they saved some good stuff for that  so let me know what you think about all  of these reveals today in the comments  down below it's been a great day i want  to thank everybody for supporting the  channel without you all i could not do  this look out for my black panther  wakanda forever teaser trailer breakdown  tomorrow be sure to follow me on  instagram and twitter for some updates  and as always i love you all in every  universe woof  you

